/S /H3
/T (A romantic architectural masterpiece from the 19th century, it combines elements from different styles, from Gothic to Moorish, resulting in a unique mix of vibrant colors and extravagant details. Built by King Ferdinand II, the Pena Palace is an iconic landmark and a testament to the imagination and creativity of the time. With its imposing turrets and stunning panoramic views, the palace is a popular tourist destination, offering visitors a fascinating experience amid stunning scenery.)
